{{!
    @template local_ltiaccountmerge/first_launch_hint

    Notice added above the core LTI account-binding dialog and the LTI launch error pages (optional setting).
    It never replaces core content.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * title - Plain text title (already escaped by the catalogue)
    * body - Safe HTML body (limited by the HTML policy)
    * hassupport - Whether a support contact is configured
    * support - Support contact (plain text)

    Example context (json):
    {
        "title": "Signing in from your learning platform",
        "body": "<p>If you already have an account here, ask the help desk to link it.</p>",
        "hassupport": true,
        "support": "helpdesk@example.org"
    }
}}
<aside class="local-ltiam-hint alert alert-info my-3" role="note" aria-labelledby="ltiam-hint-title" data-ltiam-hint="1">
    <h2 id="ltiam-hint-title" class="h5">{{{title}}}</h2>
    <div class="ltiam-hint-body">{{{body}}}</div>
    {{#hassupport}}
    <p class="mb-0">{{#str}}supportcontact, local_ltiaccountmerge{{/str}} {{support}}</p>
    {{/hassupport}}
</aside>
